      "summary": {
        "en": "At the start of the battle, summons \"Lightning-Lord.\" When \"Lightning-Lord\" takes action, launches Follow-Up ATK to automatically deal minor Lightning DMG to one random enemy and adjacent targets.",
        "zh-CN": "战斗开始时召唤【神君】，【神君】行动时发动追加攻击，自动对随机敌方单体及其相邻目标造成少量雷属性伤害。"
